### VisionCart Backend API Tests

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/health

### 2. Send Verification Code (QQ Mail SMTP)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/send-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### 3. Login with Code
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "code": "123456"
}

### 4. NLP Parse (requires auth)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/nlp/parse
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "text": "我想买一双红色的耐克运动鞋"
}

### 5. Image Recognition (requires auth)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/recognition/analyze
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

< image=@test.jpg

### 6. Product Search (requires auth)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/search/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "keywords": ["运动鞋", "耐克"],
  "platforms": ["taobao", "pdd", "ebay"]
}

### 7. Get Attribute Options
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/recognition/attribute-options?category=鞋子&attribute=颜色
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Get Favorites
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Get History
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/history?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
